# electron-builder output for the installer package.
#
# Same reasoning as packages/desktop/.gitignore: the generated files outlive a branch
# switch, and an ignore rule that only exists on the branch that generated them leaves
# ~700 MB of artifacts (a 234 MB portable exe plus its expanded tree) sitting untracked
# and unignored in every other working copy — one `git add -A` away from a commit.
#
#   out/   — electron-builder output: the portable exe and win-unpacked/
#   dist/  — already ignored by the repo root, but named here too because build.mjs
#            writes it and a reader of this file should not have to know that
out/
dist/